<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Semi-Automatic Motorbike Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>Semi-automatic motorbike rental in Hanoi runs at a verified 150,000 VND per day, the entry tier of the price list, carried by the two classic machines of Vietnamese daily life, the Honda Wave and the Yamaha Sirius. This guide plans a day on a semi-automatic around that number: what the class is, who it suits, how the daily rate compares with the weekly and monthly structures, and what to confirm before riding away.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, the character of the gear-shift underbones, the break-even where the weekly rate takes over, honest daily budget planning, and the comparison against the automatics that share the entry tier. Every verified rate in the city is listed in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, the full model range is in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a> collects the questions renters ask most.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">the verified daily price</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">what a semi-automatic is</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">why riders choose the semi-automatic</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">the daily break-even</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">planning a daily budget</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">the semi-automatics against the automatics</a></li>
